msgid "Runtime Interaction Model"
msgstr "运行时交互模型"

#: ../../03-tech-stack.md:83 174d4228bb274e3cb1e1ea1b4c9e6bb5
msgid ""
"For the **documented runtime**: a client request enters the Nginx event "
"loop and the `content_by_lua*`-style handler runs as a Lua coroutine; any"
" backend talk happens over cosockets (which yield the coroutine back to "
"the event loop) rather than blocking. See "
"[Architecture](02-architecture.md) and [Workflows](06-workflows.md)."
msgstr ""
"对于**所记录的运行时**：客户端请求进入 Nginx 事件循环，`content_by_lua*` 风格的处理器以 Lua "
"协程运行；任何后端通信都通过 "
"cosocket（它会把协程让回事件循环）而非阻塞完成。参见[架构](02-architecture.md)和[工作流](06-workflows.md)。"

